/// Dynamic RLS directly on GL Balance Snapshots* (the model has no Company dimension): each user sees the company codes listed for their UPN in _RLS Company Access; Company code ALL gives all companies. Assign one Entra group with all users to this role in the Power BI service. Users not in the access list see no rows.
role 'Company access'
	modelPermission: read

	tablePermission '_RLS Company Access' = '_RLS Company Access'[UPN] = LOWER( USERPRINCIPALNAME( ) )

	tablePermission 'GL Balance Snapshots*' =
			VAR _v_user = LOWER( USERPRINCIPALNAME( ) )
			VAR _v_company_codes =
			    CALCULATETABLE(
			        VALUES( '_RLS Company Access'[Company code] ),
			        '_RLS Company Access'[UPN] = _v_user
			    )
			RETURN
			    "ALL" IN _v_company_codes
			        || 'GL Balance Snapshots*'[company_code] IN _v_company_codes

	annotation PBI_Id = aae907468c3149f290791faca9599ae7

